  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_system_01",
      "hash64": "E9778D61F010DAE0",
      "text": "Au milieu de ce bric-à-brac se trouve\\nun bibelot couvert de poussière.\\r\\nIl dégage une odeur extrêmement sucrée !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_system_02",
      "hash64": "E9779061F010DFF9",
      "text": "Tiens ? Il semble avoir bougé...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_system_03",
      "hash64": "E9778F61F010DE46",
      "text": "Motiti ♪ Motiti ♪ Motiti ♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_01",
      "hash64": "A84FD78B63CAAC2F",
      "text": "Allô, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ?\\nC’est moi, Pepper ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_02",
      "hash64": "A84FD88B63CAADE2",
      "text": "Alors comme ça, t’es parti[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e en voyage scolaire,\\nPUIS en échange dans une autre école ?\\c\\nOn t’arrête plus, toi, quand tu pars à l’aventure ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_select_01",
      "hash64": "BF719182D239233B",
      "text": "C’était incroyable !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_select_02",
      "hash64": "BF719282D23924EE",
      "text": "Oh, c’était pas grand-chose...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_03",
      "hash64": "A84FD98B63CAAF95",
      "text": "Ah ouais ? J’suis trop jaloux...\\nJe serais bien venu avec toi ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_04",
      "hash64": "A84FD28B63CAA3B0",
      "text": "L[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0706)]e garsa fille voyage de partout, et [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0402)]ilelle dit que c’est\\n« pas grand-chose » ?!\\c\\nTu parles comme si c’était normal de faire\\ntout ça à ton âge ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0706"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0402"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 156,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_05",
      "hash64": "A84FD38B63CAA563",
      "text": "Mais c’est vrai que depuis que t’as débarqué\\nà l’école, il s’est passé que des trucs de dingue...\\r\\nAlors, ça devrait pas m’étonner.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_06",
      "hash64": "A84FD48B63CAA716",
      "text": "Enfin bon, j’imagine que ça doit bien t’occuper !\\nT’as un peu plus de temps libre en ce moment ?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_07",
      "hash64": "A84FD58B63CAA8C9",
      "text": "Parce qu’en fait, euh... J’voulais te demander\\nun truc... Si ça te dérange pas, bien sûr...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_08",
      "hash64": "A84FDE8B63CAB814",
      "text": "J’aimerais bien... te rendre visite chez toi.\\nC’est possible ?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_select_03",
      "hash64": "BF719382D23926A1",
      "text": "Avec plaisir !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_select_04",
      "hash64": "BF719482D2392854",
      "text": "Pourquoi ? Tout va bien ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_09",
      "hash64": "A84FDF8B63CAB9C7",
      "text": "Sérieux ? Je m’attendais pas à ce que t’acceptes\\nsi vite ! Trop cool ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_10",
      "hash64": "A8535C8B63CDC405",
      "text": "Euh... oui, oui ! C’est juste que t’es m[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0102)]ona meilleur[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e\\nami[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e. Du coup... j’me suis dit que ça serait cool...\\r\\nGenre, on s’rend visite, tranquille. Tu vois ?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
